{
  "adapter": "prism4.reference-json",
  "artifacts": [
    {
      "body": "Prism 4.0 is a lightweight governance protocol for humans and AI to maintain clear collaboration state in complex work. Core stays thin: Topic, Artifact, Capability, Invocation, Decision Semantics.",
      "id": "artifact:intent.foundation",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "authoritative",
        "evolution": "supersedable"
      },
      "role": "intent",
      "title": "Foundation Intent",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    },
    {
      "body": "Current slice: validate the Phase 2 JSON reference adapter and keep CLI cutover deferred. Review, Clarify, Record Decision, and Plan have minimal protocol evidence.",
      "id": "artifact:brief.current",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "projected",
        "evolution": "regenerable"
      },
      "role": "brief",
      "title": "Current Brief",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    },
    {
      "body": "The local representation should persist Topic, Artifact, SemanticPayload, Invocation, and Relation without making storage layout part of Core.",
      "id": "artifact:findings.phase-2",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "advisory",
        "evolution": "historical"
      },
      "role": "findings",
      "title": "Phase 2 Findings",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation.phase-2"
    },
    {
      "body": "Accepted: use JsonReferenceStoreAdapter as the Phase 2 dogfood representation. The single-file JSON format is adapter evidence, not the Prism Core storage contract.",
      "id": "artifact:decision.phase-2-json-adapter",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "authoritative",
        "evolution": "historical"
      },
      "role": "decision",
      "title": "Use JSON Reference Adapter",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    },
    {
      "body": "1. Keep the JSON adapter minimal. 2. Use this dogfood state as the first persisted 4.0 Topic. 3. Defer canonical CLI cutover until the protocol remains stable under this state.",
      "id": "artifact:plan.next",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "operative-after-authorization",
        "evolution": "historical-supersedable"
      },
      "role": "plan",
      "title": "Next Plan",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    },
    {
      "body": "1. CLI 与技能文档曾漂移：topic new 签名不一致、decision verb 被 legacy 路由拦截、plan / decision record 语义已定义但未接线。现已对齐并新增测试覆盖。2. resolve_root() 的 workspace 发现路径 workspace.*.local/topics/*/ 仍是 3.x 目录布局残留；4.0 JSON adapter 只需要 state 文件所在目录，桥接布局尚未被 4.0 语义重新定义。3. dogfood 状态与 SDK 仓库耦合：当前作为测试夹具随分支演进合理，但 Prism 项目自身的活跃协作状态在 4.0 稳定后应评估迁移到 Workspace backend。",
      "id": "artifact:findings.cli-cutover-round",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "advisory",
        "evolution": "historical"
      },
      "role": "findings",
      "title": "CLI Cutover Round Findings",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    },
    {
      "body": "Dogfood 状态在 4.0 稳定前保持 SDK 仓库内证据角色（测试夹具随分支演进）；4.0 稳定后评估迁移到 Workspace backend 或 workspace.prism.local 桥接。",
      "id": "artifact:decision.state-placement",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "authoritative",
        "authority_required": "human-required",
        "evolution": "committed"
      },
      "role": "decision",
      "title": "Dogfood State Placement",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    },
    {
      "body": "技能说明使用中文；协议原语术语（Topic / Artifact / Capability / Invocation / Decision / Intent / Brief / Findings / Plan / Review / Clarify）保留英文，与 grounding 文档 SSOT 一致。",
      "id": "artifact:decision.skill-language",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "authoritative",
        "authority_required": "human-required",
        "evolution": "committed"
      },
      "role": "decision",
      "title": "Skill Language Policy",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    },
    {
      "body": "F1 偏离·高: Phase 1 Protocol Skeleton 被整体跳过，protocol/ 6 份文档未落地；施工顺序与计划相反（代码先行、文档追认），core.py 编码决策有固化为事实 schema 的风险。F2 缺口·高: 跨域验证 0/3，所有 dogfood 都发生在\"Prism 重构自己\"的元领域，协议通用性从未被攻击；MVP 完成条件（三个领域 case）远未满足。F3 缺口·中: Intent 无演进路径，--intent 仅创建时可用，Decision 授权后的 Intent 修正只能手工编辑 JSON，权威工件会陈旧并诱使绕开协议。F4 观察·低: Child Topic 用 phase 序号命名（phase-2），与\"独立协作边界\"语义相悖，计划建议的语义命名（prism-4-cli-adapter 等）未采用。F5 观察: resolve_root 的 workspace.*.local/topics/*/ 发现路径是 3.x 布局残留且无测试覆盖（上轮已记录，仍 open）。F6 观察·中: Brief 投影仅输出工件标题+计数，不含 Intent 正文与 Decision 摘要，\"低熵恢复入口\"目标未达成。建议顺序: 1) 补 protocol/ 文档 2) 启动最小跨域 case 3) Intent 更新路径 4) Brief 增强 5) 命名与 resolve_root 清理。",
      "id": "artifact:findings.progress-review-2026-08-15",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "advisory",
        "evolution": "historical"
      },
      "role": "findings",
      "title": "Progress Review 2026-08-15",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    },
    {
      "body": "F1 缺口·高: prism-review 技能丢失了 3.x workflow-review 的多视角 subagent 方法论（2-5 角色独立调研 + merge 去重仲裁 + 独立发现率 + 并发诚实性 Safety Gate）。4.0 把 workflow 编排与方法论一起丢弃——丢弃编排正确，丢弃方法论误杀。F2 风险·高: 单视角 Review 功能上退化为\"调查事实+写观察\"，与 Clarify 的\"调查事实+提问\"高度重叠；用户已反馈可能转而直接使用 Clarify 替代 Review。Review 的不可替代性来自视角对冲，而非产出格式。F3 观察: 多视角是 alignment §18 Open Question 3（Review 是否覆盖 evaluation/inspection/assessment/insight extraction 而不拆分）的实践答案——不同视角即不同评估透镜；merge 分歧也是 Findings conflicts 类目的生产机制。修复方向: 把多视角作为方法论指导补回 prism-review 技能（视角选择策略 + 并发诚实性 + merge 收敛），保持 Findings advisory 与 4.0 落盘方式，不回归四阶段固定 workflow。",
      "id": "artifact:findings.review-multi-perspective-gap",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "advisory",
        "evolution": "historical"
      },
      "role": "findings",
      "title": "Review 多视角方法论缺失",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    },
    {
      "body": "修正上一条 Findings（review-multi-perspective-gap）的 F1 边界判断。正确区分: 4.0 反回归检查禁止的是跨能力固定 workflow（Intake→Scope→Focus→Review→Decision→Execute），而 Align→Explore→Merge→Gate 4 是 Review 能力内部的执行方法论（总分总），不是跨能力编排，应保留而非丢弃。对齐结果: prism-review 技能已重写（dev-02），保留多视角独立审视 + merge 收敛 + 并发诚实性 + 裁决边界，同时守住 4.0 边界（Findings advisory、不写 3.x 产物、裁决由 Decision Semantics 承担不强制衔接）。沉淀语义: Capability 只定义 typed I/O 与 policy、不定义流程位置；但能力内部可以有执行方法论，二者不冲突。",
      "id": "artifact:findings.review-methodology-corrected",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "advisory",
        "evolution": "historical"
      },
      "role": "findings",
      "title": "Review 方法论边界修正",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    }
